## Key Patterns

### Hydration Safety
Always use the `useIsMounted` hook for client-only rendering:
```typescript
function useIsMounted() {
  const [isMounted, setIsMounted] = useState(false)
  useEffect(() => {
    setIsMounted(true)
  }, [])
  return isMounted
}
```

### Supabase Queries
Use proper error handling and type safety:
```typescript
const { data, error } = await supabase
  .from('table')
  .select('*')
  .eq('column', value)
  .single()

if (error) throw error
```

