## Common Issues & Solutions

### Hydration Mismatch
- Use `useIsMounted` hook for client-only content
- Avoid `typeof window !== 'undefined'` checks
- Ensure consistent initial state

### TypeScript Errors
- Add proper null checks with `?.` and `??`
- Use type assertions sparingly (`as any`)
- Define proper interfaces in `src/types/index.ts`

### Performance
- Use React.memo for expensive components
- Implement virtual scrolling for large lists
- Lazy load images with OptimizedImage component
- Use code splitting for admin panel

